    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "THIS IS A NICE TWO BEDROOMED TERRACED HOUSE DECEPTIVE EXTERNALLY WITH A SUPERB AND PARTICULARLY SPACIOUS REAR GARDEN.  THE LOCATION IS MATURED IN THE PLEASANT SUBURBAN VILLAGE OF BALLINTEMPLE WITH A VARIETY OF AMENITIES ADJACENT AND IS OF COURSE JUST A SHORT STROLL TO THE RECENTLY UPGRADED MARINA PARK AND WALKWAY."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "ACCOMMODATION:\r\n\r\nEntrance Hallway: \r\n\t\r\nSitting/Dining Room:  16 x 10     Fireplace\r\n\r\nGalley kitchen:             12 x 7.6   Fitted kitchen.    Plumbed for appliances\r\n\r\n*Separate Utility area\r\n\r\n*Bathroom:    Three piece suite.  Instant electric shower.\r\n\r\nFIRST FLOOR:\r\n\r\nBedroom (1):   15.6 x 9.8\r\n\r\nBedroom (2):   10 x 7\r\n\r\nOUTSIDE:\r\n\r\nVery spacious lawned garden to rear."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "**NATURAL GAS CENTRAL HEATING**\r\n\r\n**ADJACENT TO VERY MANY LOCAL AMENITIES**\r\n\r\n**FINE REAR LAWNED GARDEN**"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "BER Details",
        "SortOrder": 4,
